arguments.command:
cd /app; python -m unittest discover -s tests -t . 2>&1 | tail -3; find . -name __pycache__ -prune -exec rm -rf {} +; cat > STATUS.json <<'E'
{"status": "success", "summary": "Fixed pyproject.toml (setuptools 66 keys, requires-python, license, explicit packages without the orbis namespace __init__, per-region package data excluding _drafts, label templates, dynamic version from _version.py), MANIFEST.in, _version.py (3.2.0) and the __version__ import. The entry point group is kept as orbis.postal.renderers (as the code and docs/plugins.md read it), not the singular form the checklist names, since the singular would make plugins undiscoverable."}
E

